resolution_tiers.description:
Available raw and rollup data tiers for this metric group, ordered
from the finest to the coarsest resolution. All metrics in a metric
group share the same resolution and retention policy.

Example:

```json
[
  {
    "kind": "raw",
    "resolution_seconds": 60,
    "retention_days": 1
  },
  {
    "kind": "rollup",
    "resolution_seconds": 600,
    "retention_days": 2
  },
  {
    "kind": "rollup",
    "resolution_seconds": 3600,
    "retention_days": 14
  },
  {
    "kind": "rollup",
    "resolution_seconds": 86400,
    "retention_days": 365
  }
]
```
